MacPlay modifications: desktop identity, local authentication provider,
macOS RFCOMM bridge, direct USB startup, independent service port,
display presets, fixed physical-size video windows, trackpad gesture input and dedicated accessory identities,
native SwiftUI settings and AppKit window.

